# LeakSanitizer suppressions for bugs that are known, understood and NOT reachable on Ruby.
# fuzz/run.sh passes this file in LSAN_OPTIONS. Every entry says why it is safe and when
# to remove it. Never add an entry for a bug in Ruby's own code: fix it instead.
